{"title": "Continual Flame (Condition)", "pageid": 34038, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Continual_Flame_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Continual Flame</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Enveloped in flames that produce no heat and never seem to die out.</li>\n<li>Identical to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\">Light</a> condition. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LIGHT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLIGHT%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLIGHT%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Light\" title=\"SG Light\">SG_Light</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects five <a href=\"/wiki/Standing_Torch\" title=\"Standing Torch\">Standing Torches</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> near <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-48&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;41</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LIGHT</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Continual_Flame\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Continual_Flame_(Condition)\" title=\"Continual Flame (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Continual Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Continual Flame</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Enveloped in flames that produce no heat and never seem to die out.</li>\n<li>Identical to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\">Light</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Light\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\">Light</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This object has an aura of light with a radius of 7.5 m (25 ft).</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041233\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1854/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17871/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4843/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1114260/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.697      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   50.697      1 -total\n 49.56%   25.127      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 22.42%   11.364      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.73%    9.494      5 Template:Icon_link\n 17.65%    8.947      5 Template:Icon_text\n 15.39%    7.801      1 Template:Cond\n 15.36%    7.788     18 Template:Trim\n 13.77%    6.981      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 13.52%    6.853      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34038-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041233 and revision id 374720. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}